# Inhibition (ADR-0009 dec. 7): a firing thrash episode mutes the SWAP-volume
# NOTICE but not its episode — a swap-volume red under active thrash is the same
# event told twice. (Before banshee-yk8 this row muted the Memory notice; Memory
# is now advisory and never opens or notifies, so the redundant pairing moved to
# Swap.) Empty the table and both bells ring for one event.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/episode.rs
test: thrash_inhibits_the_swap_notice_but_not_the_swap_episode
---OLD---
        Dimension::Swap => &[Dimension::Thrash],
---NEW---
        Dimension::Swap => &[],
